- Fix ly build failure: vendor Zig package-manager dependencies
  (clap, zigini, termbox2, translate-c) as ly-zig-cache.tar.gz and
  serve them to zig via --global-cache-dir, because OBS build
  chroots are offline and zig's git fetches fail with
  NameServerFailure. update.sh regenerates the cache on version
  bumps when pinned dependency hashes change.

